OL,3,ACar driver 'did a U-turn' in order to
OL,4,Ahit Australian MP, prime minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralian MP Helen Haines remains in a
OL,7,Fcritical condition after being hit by a
OL,8,Fcar in what Prime Minister Anthony
OL,9,FAlbanese calls "a deliberate act"
OL,11,FAlbanese says the car did a U-turn in
OL,12,Forder to strike the MP as she stood by
OL,13,Fthe boot of her car near her office in
OL,14,FWangaratta, Victoria
OL,16,FA 43-year-old man, from nearby
OL,17,FTarrawingee, was detained at the scene
OL,18,Fby a passer-by before being taken into
OL,19,Fcustody
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
