OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspect is to be questioned by
OL,7,Fpolice this morning after spending the
OL,8,Fnight in custody
OL,10,FThe 65-year-old independent MP has
OL,11,Fundergone surgery after being taken by
OL,12,Fhelicopter to hospital in Melbourne
